{"availability":"available","full":"just-not-google/BiNeuron","name":"BiNeuron","description":"BiNeuron is a local AI assistant that detects programming languages from requests/files, selects specialized models based on hardware, and generates code/docs/analysis via configurable prompts. It extracts text from PDFs, Word, images (OCR), and other formats, translates, filters profanity, and uses proxies if needed. Runs offline.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":10,"forks":2,"created":"2026-08-25T13:36:52Z","updated":"2026-09-29T11:39:42Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://github.com/just-not-google/BiNeuron","topics":["ai","ai-agents","ai-coding","ai-tools","deepseek","for-developers","for-development","for-devs","hugging-face","local","local-ai","local-first","local-llm","localhost","minimax","open-code","open-source","proxy","proxy-list"],"demo":null,"color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T05:04:48.221Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T05:04:48.221Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T05:04:48.221Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T05:04:48.221Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T05:04:48.221Z","stars":10,"forks":2}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Intelligent Code Analysis and Generation Platform","BiNeuron is a sophisticated software solution that bridges the gap between human intent and machine generated code. It unifies advanced natural language processing, optical character recognition, and adaptive model selection into a single, powerful tool designed for developers, researchers, and technical teams.","At its core, BiNeuron automatically identifies the programming language of a given request, extracts content from a wide array of file formats, including images and documents, and then generates context aware, production ready code using best in class local or cloud based language models."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/just-not-goo